course: dictionary
lesson: 15825
title: Undefined: when something is not clear
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Undefined means not clearly explained, described or fixed. If a job has an undefined role, nobody has said exactly what the job is. The start of the word, un-, often means "not", and defined means "clearly explained", so you can split the word to work it out.
explain: «The rules of the game were undefined, so we argued all afternoon.» The clue is that we argued: nobody knew the rules clearly. Try your meaning in the sentence: "The rules were not clearly explained, so we argued all afternoon." It still makes sense.
explain: Undefined has special meanings in maths and computing. «6 ÷ 0 is undefined» because no number times 0 gives 6, so there is no answer. In computing, a value that has not been given yet is undefined, and the computer may show it as an error.
fact: Undefined means not clearly explained, described or fixed.
fact: Undefined can also mean without a clear shape or outline, like «an undefined grey blob in the sky».
fact: Un- at the start of a word often means "not", so undefined means "not defined".
fact: In maths, «6 ÷ 0» is undefined, because no number times 0 gives 6.
fact: In computing, a variable is undefined when it has not been given a value yet.
exercise: «The rules of the game were undefined, so we argued all afternoon.» What does undefined mean here? | Brightly coloured | Finished on time | *Not clearly explained | Very long and hard
exercise: Why is «6 ÷ 0» undefined? | Because the answer is always 6 | Because 0 is the biggest number | Because 6 is an odd number | *Because no number times 0 gives 6
exercise: «The cloud was an undefined grey blob in the sky.» What does undefined suggest? | Sharp and pointy | *Without a clear shape or outline | Full of loud noise | Very tall and thin
test: «Mum said the new helper's job was undefined, so nobody knew what to do.» What does undefined mean? | *Not clearly described | Brightly lit | Very quick | Full of happy people
test: In computing, a variable with no value yet is ____. Which word fits? | happy | defined | perfect | *undefined
exam: «The map showed an undefined area of the sea, with no clear edges.» What is the best meaning of undefined here? | Hidden under a bridge | Shown in bright colours | Measured exactly to the inch | *Not clearly shown, with no clear edges
